ext-slate-800\">The <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">5</span><input id=\"q-5\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span></p>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 mb-6 space-y-3\">\n                <li>Location: At the top of a <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">6</span><input id=\"q-6\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span></li>\n                <li>Reason: All the <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">7</span><input id=\"q-7\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span> are very good</li>\n                <li>Reason: Only uses <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">8</span><input id=\"q-8\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span> ingredients</li>\n                <li>Other: Set lunch costs £ <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">9</span><input id=\"q-9\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span> per person</li>\n                <li>Other: Portions probably of <span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"font-bold text-sm\">10</span><input id=\"q-10\" type=\"text\" class=\"border-b border-black w-32 focus:outline-none focus:border-blue-500 bg-transparent font-semibold\" /></span> size</li>\n            </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      ",
